  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://www.gims.ac.in/recruitment.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Government Institute of Medical Sciences (GIMS), Noida</a></span> has released a notification for the recruitment of <strong data-start=\"240\" data-end=\"274\">Staf Nurse Posts</strong>&nbsp;on its official website. This recruitment has been announced for a total of <strong data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"727\">100 posts</strong>. The <strong data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"829\">online application process for GIMS Noida Staff Nurse Recruitment 2026 </strong>has started from<strong data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"829\"> 10 August 2026</strong>, and candidates can apply <strong data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"878\">until 07 September 2026</strong>. Candidates are advised to check the complete details for <strong>GIMS Noida Staff Nurse&nbsp;Recruitment 2026</strong> given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Government Institute of Medical Sciences (GIMS)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">GIMS Noida Staff Nurse Recruitment 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UPSSSC Advt No:- GIMS/2026/Manpower/NT- 03/10</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<l