size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per UPSSSC GIMS Noida Staff Nurse Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Use <span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool –</span> </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>GIMS Noida Staff Nurse </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 100 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Post Name&nbsp;</span></strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Category</span></strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">No. of Posts</span></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"5\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Staff Nurse</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">40</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">OBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">27</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">10</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">21</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">02</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>GIMS Noida Staff Nurse Recruitment 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For Degree Holder :</strong> B.Sc Nursing (4-Year) or B.Sc Nursing (Post Basic) (2-Year) from an INC/State Council-recognized University/Institute + Registered as a Nurse &amp; Midwife with the State/Indian Nursing Council.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For Diploma Holder :</strong> Diploma in General Nursing Midwifery (GNM) from an INC-recognized Board/Council + Registered as Nurse &amp; Midwife with the State/Indian Nursing Council + 2 years’ experience in a minimum 50-bedded hospital after completing the diploma</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Read Official Notification Before Applying.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>GIMS Noida Staff Nurse Online Form 2026 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://www.gims.ac.in/recruitment.html or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the GIMS before Last Date.</spa